==Strategy==
Aside from using the meatshields [[Eraser Cat]], [[Manic Eraser Cat]] and [[Boulder Cat]], your main priorities should be [[Hitman Cat]] (to defeat Mega Baa Baa easily) and [[Ancient Egg: N000 (Special Cat)|Ape Lord Luza]] (huge damage to the Puffingtons), and the rest of the units can be support such as [[Cadaver BearCat]], [[True Superfeline]] and [[Can Can Cat]]. Additionally, at level 42 and above, [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]] can kill Puffingtons in one hit, which can help a lot here, though she is very vulnerable to the other enemies here because of her low range and rushing tendency.

Obviously don't forget about [[Octopus Cat]] as it is the main counter to Diabrollow's pushing gimmick and also resists the regular Brollows.

